    <string name="settings_title">Settings</string>
    <string name="app_information_title">App Information</string>
    <string name="settings_guide_title">User Guide</string>
    <string name="settings_guide_content">1. Stack &amp; Schedule: Add supplements and choose a schedule. Home shows what is due today.\n2. Sync Center: Device A chooses encryption before Host creates a Link Code. Device B imports the key when required, pastes the code, then taps Download once.\n3. Encryption &amp; keys: Keep the key private. It is hidden by default and cannot be recovered. To change encryption or replace an exposed key, revoke the old code and host again.\n4. Notifications: Allow notifications so reminders work. You can tap Taken/Skip directly on the notification.\n5. Auto-Sync: Opening or returning to the app syncs immediately; local edits upload after a short debounce. Network and OS background limits still apply.\n6. Troubleshooting: If sync reports a missing key, import the Host key and enable Auto-Sync again. Use Notification diagnostics for reminder issues.\n7. Status &amp; filters: Green = Taken, orange = Skipped, red = Overdue. Use filters to focus on Due/Overdue quickly.</string>
    <string name="user_guide_1_title">Section 1: Stack &amp; Schedule</string>
    <string name="user_guide_1_body">Add supplements and choose a schedule (continuous, On/Off, every N days, weekly). Home shows what’s due today.</string>
    <string name="user_guide_2_title">Section 2: Sync Center</string>
    <string name="user_guide_2_body">Device A chooses encryption before Host creates a Link Code. Device B imports the key when required, pastes the code, then taps Download once.</string>
    <string name="user_guide_3_title">Section 3: Encryption &amp; Keys</string>
    <string name="user_guide_3_body">Keep the sync key private; it is hidden by default and cannot be recovered. Encryption is locked while a Link Code is active. To change mode or replace an exposed key, revoke the old code and host again.</string>
    <string name="user_guide_4_title">Section 4: Notifications</string>
    <string name="user_guide_4_body">Allow notifications so reminders work reliably. You can tap Taken/Skip directly on the notification for fast logging.</string>
    <string name="user_guide_5_title">Section 5: Auto‑Sync</string>
    <string name="user_guide_5_body">Opening or returning to the app syncs immediately. Local edits upload after a short debounce; network and OS background limits still apply. If a key is missing, import it and enable Auto-Sync again.</string>
    <string name="user_guide_6_title">Section 6: Troubleshooting</string>
    <string name="user_guide_6_body">For sync errors, verify Internet, Link Code, and encryption key first. Use Notification diagnostics for reminders and ensure Do Not Disturb is not blocking alerts.</string>
    <string name="user_guide_7_title">Section 7: Status &amp; Filters</string>
    <string name="user_guide_7_body">Green = Taken, orange = Skipped, red = Overdue. Use filters to focus on Due/Overdue quickly.</string>
    
